# Native Date & Time > Set Manually (task 014 P3e, release build: APPLAUNCH_DEV=0 hides every page that is not native,
# so the "Save?" step has to be native to show at all). Network Time on refuses the section with its reason in the
# status line; with it off the section lists Year .. Minute and Save?; a minute is set (a fresh value page), Save?
# asks Yes / No (No highlighted); the save fails (the fake clock refuses: the error in the status line, red), then
# works (back in the section, the new time shown); a date before the factory date (the harness build date is
# 2026-10-10: the clock is set to 2000-03-14) asks first in a Dialog: Cancel (Esc), then Confirm; the header's Esc
# closes the question first, and leaving the section with the question open answers no.
# Review only: no golden; every header is checked against the home
# grid's (run.sh header). Fixtures: scene commands `ntp on|off`, `timeset ok|fail` (src/harness_stubs.cpp).
title settings native date and time
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-10-10
wifi 70
bt on
ntp on
timeset fail
home
header home
launch Settings
# root: Up from Screen wraps to System, Up again is Date & Time
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
shot time_section
header time_section "Settings > Date & Time" "Date & Time" Time
# Info, Network Time, Set Manually: refused while Network Time is on
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
shot time_gated
header time_gated "Settings > Date & Time" "Date & Time" Time
# Network Time off: back to the root and in again (the section reads it when it opens)
key ESC
ntp off
key ENTER
wait 600
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
shot time_list
header time_list "Settings > Date & Time > Set Manually" "Date & Time > Set Manually" "Set Manually"
# Minute: a fresh value page; one down from 30, Enter applies and comes back with the edit kept
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
shot time_minute
header time_minute "Settings > Date & Time > Set Manually > Minute" "Date & Time > Set Manually > Minute" "Set Manually > Minute" Minute
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
shot time_edited
# Save?: No is highlighted
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
shot time_save
header time_save "Settings > Date & Time > Set Manually > Save?" "Date & Time > Set Manually > Save?" "Set Manually > Save?" "Save?"
# Yes with a clock that refuses: the error in the status line, the list stays
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
shot time_error
# the clock accepts it: back in the section with the saved time
timeset ok
key ENTER
wait 900
shot time_saved
header time_saved "Settings > Date & Time > Set Manually" "Date & Time > Set Manually" "Set Manually"
# a date before the factory date: leave Date & Time (the edits go), the clock is in 2000
key ESC
key ESC
clock 20:30 2000-03-14
key ENTER
wait 600
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
shot time_warning
header time_warning "Settings > Date & Time > Set Manually > Save?" "Date & Time > Set Manually > Save?" "Set Manually > Save?" "Save?" Warning
# Esc cancels: nothing is saved, the list stays
key ESC
wait 300
shot time_warning_cancelled
# Yes again, then the header's Esc button (at 480x320 and 800x480; the others take the key) closes the question
key ENTER
wait 600
@480x320 tap 281 20
@800x480 tap 525 28
@640x480,720x720,1280x720 key ESC
wait 300
shot time_warning_header_esc
# Yes, Confirm: the older date is written, back in the section
key ENTER
wait 600
key ENTER
wait 900
shot time_warning_saved
header time_warning_saved "Settings > Date & Time > Set Manually" "Date & Time > Set Manually" "Set Manually"
